            "Knowledge base created successfully!\n",
            "Total documents: 3\n",
            "Retrieved: Users can reset their password using the Forgot Password option on the login page.\n",
            "Source: Sample PDF, page 3\n",
            "Retrieved: Customers can check their order status through the order tracking page.\n",
            "Source: Sample PDF, page 5\n",
            "Answer: Open the login page, select 'Forgot Password,' and follow the instructions to create a new password.\n",
            "Source: Sample PDF, page 3, Sample PDF, page 5\n"
